│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ fix_bulge_boundary_delta                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ The incremental score update for an added bulge currently queries the whole strip         │
│                          │ including the original edge coordinate. Fish lying on the original edge remain inside     │
│                          │ both before and after inserting the bulge, so they must not contribute to the score       │
│                          │ delta. This can corrupt the tracked SA objective and cause the search to retain polygons  │
│                          │ whose actual score is worse than estimated.                                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Make bulge delta rectangles consistent with edge-move delta handling: exclude the         │
│                          │ removed/original edge line and include the newly created bulge line. This preserves the   │
│                          │ required “points on polygon edges are inside” semantics exactly.                          │
│ num_applied              │ 2                                                                                         │
