│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ local_coordinate_guides                                                                   │
│ patch_description        │ Static fish-coordinate snapping currently selects uniformly from every fish-derived       │
│                          │ coordinate. Once the polygon has found a promising region, this makes most proposals jump │
│                          │ across the entire board, causing rejected moves, self-intersections, and ineffective      │
│                          │ late-stage annealing.                                                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Select static guide coordinates within a radius around the moved edge instead. The radius │
│                          │ gradually shrinks with elapsed time, retaining broad exploration early while making late  │
│                          │ moves local refinements. If no guide is in range, use the closest available guide, so     │
│                          │ every proposal remains meaningful. This is especially beneficial for edge movement and    │
│                          │ bulge insertion because their score deltas are local rectangles.                          │
│ num_applied              │ 3                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0612                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ gpt-5.6-terra                                                                             │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ reasoning                │ {'effort': 'low', 'summary': 'auto'}                                                      │
